  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dd75c5084437148469cb65eb6ce0a716, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueTree_Aurelia
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Edenfall.Runtime::Edenfall.Dialogue.DialogueTree
  treeId: tree_aurelia_main
  characterId: aurelia
  initialNodeId: aur_welcome
  nodes:
  - nodeId: aur_welcome
    speakerName: Aurelia
    emotion: 0
    textVi: "Ch\xE0o m\u1EEBng ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111\xE3 t\u1EC9nh gi\u1EA5c t\u1EA1i
      Th\xE1nh \u0110\u1ECBa B\xECnh Minh, l\u1EEF kh\xE1ch. Ta l\xE0 Aurelia. R\u1EA5t
      hi\u1EBFm ai c\xF3 th\u1EC3 v\u01B0\u1EE3t qua d\xF2ng ch\u1EA3y h\u01B0 kh\xF4ng
      m\xE0 v\u1EABn gi\u1EEF tr\u1ECDn v\u1EB9n th\u1EA7n tr\xED. Ng\u01B0\u01A1i
      c\xF3 b\u1ECB th\u01B0\u01A1ng \u1EDF \u0111\xE2u kh\xF4ng?"
    textEn: Welcome to Dawn Sanctuary, outsider. My name is Aurelia. Few awaken with
      their senses intact after crossing the celestial void. Are you hurt?
    choices:
    - choiceId: c1
      textVi: "Ta ch\u1EC9 nh\u1EDB \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \xE1nh sao v\xE0 m\u1ED9t
        giai \u0111i\u1EC7u d\u1ECBu d\xE0ng... r\u1ED3i sau \u0111\xF3 nghe th\u1EA5y
        gi\u1ECDng n\xF3i c\u1EE7a n\xE0ng."
      textEn: I remember only starlight and a melody... and then your voice.
      tone: 2
      reqAffection: 0
      reqTrust: 0
      reqItemId: 
      affectionDelta: 6
      trustDelta: 5
      familiarityDelta: 2
      respectDelta: 0
      comfortDelta: 0
      conflictDelta: 0
      memoryTextVi: "B\u1ED9c l\u1ED9 s\u1EF1 ch\xE2n th\xE0nh v\xE0 y\u1EBFu m\u1EC1m
        ngay khi v\u1EEBa t\u1EC9nh gi\u1EA5c c\xF9ng Aurelia."
      memoryTextEn: Spoke with genuine vulnerability upon first waking with Aurelia.
      triggerCinematicId: 
      triggerQuestId: 
      triggerQuestStep: -1
      nextNodeId: aur_reassure
    - choiceId: c2
      textVi: "N\xE0ng l\xE0 ai m\xE0 d\xE1m ch\u1EA5t v\u1EA5n m\u1ED9t Echo? H\xE3y
        gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch cho ta bi\u1EBFt \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC \u0111\xE3 x\xE9
        to\u1EA1c v\xF9ng \u0111\u1EA5t n\xE0y."
      textEn: Who are you to question an Echo? Tell me what shattered this realm.
      tone: 3
      reqAffection: 0
      reqTrust: 0
      reqItemId: 
      affectionDelta: 0
      trustDelta: 0
      familiarityDelta: 2
      respectDelta: 3
      comfortDelta: 0
      conflictDelta: 4
      memoryTextVi: "Th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n kh\xED ch\u1EA5t ki\xEAu h\xE3nh v\xE0 b\u1EA5t
        khu\u1EA5t tr\u01B0\u1EDBc Aurelia."
      memoryTextEn: Exhibited fiery pride and independence before Aurelia.
      triggerCinematicId: 
      triggerQuestId: 
      triggerQuestStep: -1
      nextNodeId: aur_defiant
    - choiceId: c3
      textVi: "Ta mu\u1ED1n t\xECm hi\u1EC3u v\u1EC1 Th\xE1nh \u0110\u1ECBa n\xE0y
        v\xE0 C\xE1nh C\u1ED5ng Nh\u1EADt Th\u1EF1c \u1EDF ph\xEDa nam."
      textEn: I need to understand this sanctuary and the Eclipse Gate to the south.
      tone: 1
      reqAffection: 0
      reqTrust: 0
      reqItemId: 
      affectionDelta: 0
      trustDelta: 4
      familiarityDelta: 2
      respectDelta: 4
      comfortDelta: 0
      conflictDelta: 0
      memoryTextVi: 
      memoryTextEn: 
      triggerCinematicId: 
      triggerQuestId: 
      triggerQuestStep: -1
      nextNodeId: aur_explain
  - nodeId: aur_intimate
    speakerName: Aurelia
    emotion: 3
    textVi: "M\u1ED7i khi ng\u01B0\u01A1i nh\xECn ta b\u1EB1ng \xE1nh m\u1EAFt \u1EA5y,
      Echo... ta l\u1EA1i c\u1EA3m th\u1EA5y Thi\xEAn \u0110\u01B0\u1EDDng V\u1EE1
      V\u1EE5n n\xE0y kh\xF4ng h\u1EC1 m\u1EA5t \u0111i, m\xE0 \u0111ang ch\u1EDD
      ch\xFAng ta c\xF9ng nhau t\xE1i thi\u1EBFt. Tim ta \u0111\u1EADp r\u1ED9n r\xE0ng
      m\u1ED7i khi ng\u01B0\u01A1i b\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0o V\u01B0\u1EDDn B\xECnh Minh."
    textEn: Whenever you look at me like that, Echo... I feel this Shattered Paradise
      is waiting for us to rebuild together. My heart races whenever you enter Dawn
      Garden.
    choices:
    - choiceId: c_romance
      textVi: "V\u1EADy h\xE3y c\xF9ng ta t\xE1i sinh l\u1EA1i Edenfall, Aurelia.
        \u0110\u1EBFn g\u1EA7n ta h\u01A1n n\u1EEFa \u0111i."
      textEn: Then let us rebuild Edenfall together, Aurelia. Come closer.
      tone: 0
      reqAffection: 0
      reqTrust: 0
      reqItemId: 
      affectionDelta: 8
      trustDelta: 0
      familiarityDelta: 2
      respectDelta: 0
      comfortDelta: 10
      conflictDelta: 0
      memoryTextVi: "Trao nhau l\u1EDDi th\u1EC1 \u01B0\u1EDBc ng\u1ECDt ng\xE0o
        d\u01B0\u1EDBi v\xF2m hoa tinh t\xFA."
      memoryTextEn: Shared a sweet, tender vow beneath the starlight blossoms.
      triggerCinematicId: cg_aurelia_garden
      triggerQuestId: 
      triggerQuestStep: -1
      nextNodeId: 
    - choiceId: c_flirt
      textVi: "N\xE0ng c\xF2n r\u1EF1c r\u1EE1 v\xE0 cu\u1ED1n h\xFAt h\u01A1n c\u1EA3
        tri\u1EC7u v\xEC sao tr\xEAn v\xF2m tr\u1EDDi kia."
      textEn: You are far more captivating than the millions of stars above.
      tone: 5
      reqAffection: 0
      reqTrust: 0
      reqItemId: 
      affectionDelta: 7
      trustDelta: 0
      familiarityDelta: 2
      respectDelta: 0
      comfortDelta: 5
      conflictDelta: 0
      memoryTextVi: 
      memoryTextEn: 
      triggerCinematicId: 
      triggerQuestId: 
      triggerQuestStep: -1
      nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: aur_reassure
    speakerName: Aurelia
    emotion: 1
    textVi: "Ng\u01B0\u01A1i th\u1EADt c\xF3 t\xE0i \u0103n n\xF3i... Gi\u1ECDng
      \u0111i\u1EC7u c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i nh\u01B0 \xE1nh n\u1EAFng s\u01B0\u1EDFi
      \u1EA5m nh\u1EEFng t\u1EA3ng b\u0103ng ngh\xECn n\u0103m trong th\xE1nh \u0111i\u1EC7n.
      H\xE3y nh\u1EADn \u0111\xF3a Hoa Ly B\xECnh Minh n\xE0y, n\xF3 s\u1EBD b\u1EA3o
      h\u1ED9 cho linh h\u1ED3n ng\u01B0\u01A1i."
    textEn: You have a gentle way with words... Your tone warms the ancient ice in
      this sanctuary. Take this Dawn Lily, it will protect your spirit.
    choices: []
  - nodeId: aur_defiant
    speakerName: Aurelia
    emotion: 4
    textVi: "Kh\xED kh\xE1i \u0111\xE1ng khen, nh\u01B0ng l\xF2ng ki\xEAu h\xE3nh
      m\xF9 qu\xE1ng s\u1EBD ch\u1EC9 d\u1EABn ng\u01B0\u01A1i v\xE0o nanh vu\u1ED1t
      c\u1EE7a H\u1EAFc Kh\xED V\u1EF1c Th\u1EB3m. N\u1EBFu ng\u01B0\u01A1i mu\u1ED1n
      s\u1ED1ng s\xF3t, h\xE3y h\u1ECDc c\xE1ch tin t\u01B0\u1EDFng \u0111\u1ED3ng
      minh."
    textEn: A fierce spirit, but blind pride will only lead you into the jaws of
      the Miasma. If you wish to survive, learn to trust allies.
    choices: []
  - nodeId: aur_explain
    speakerName: Aurelia
    emotion: 6
    textVi: "N\u01A1i n\xE0y l\xE0 t\xE0n t\xEDch cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng c\u1EE7a V\u1EA7ng
      Th\xE1i D\u01B0\u01A1ng. C\xE1nh C\u1ED5ng Nh\u1EADt Th\u1EF1c ph\xEDa nam
      \u0111ang r\u1EA1n n\u1EE9t t\u1EEBng ng\xE0y. N\u1EBFu ch\xFAng ta kh\xF4ng
      k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t l\u1EA1i L\xF5i Tinh T\xFA t\u1EA1i T\xF2a Th\xE1p V\u1EE1
      V\u1EE5n, b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i s\u1EBD nu\u1ED1t ch\u1EEDng t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3."
    textEn: This place is the last remnant of the Solstice Sun. The Eclipse Gate
      fractures daily. If we do not attune the Astral Core, darkness will consume
      all.
    choices: []
